/-!
# Wasm specification library: `SumTo` v1, results

Solutions of `Spec` (see `manifest.toml`):

* `tactic`: `Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo.spec_tactic` (`Silmaril.Proofs.WasmSpec.SumTo.Tactic`);
* `tactic+script`: `Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo.Script.spec_script`, generated by
  `tools/wasm-vc gen` (`Silmaril.Proofs.WasmSpec.SumTo.Script`);
* `all-in`: `Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo.AllIn.spec_allin`, from `tools/wasm-vc agent`
  run **blind** (the model saw a copy of the checkout without this entry's
  other solutions and lemma files): the invariant and `tri_step_nat` are the
  model's, checked by z3 and Lean (`agentic/log.md`);
* `all-in`, assisted: `Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo.AllInAssisted.spec_allin`, the same
  loop with the other solutions visible (`agentic/assisted-log.md`).
* `tactic+smt` (SAT-backed `bv_decide`) is kept off the main tree, on branch
  `wasm-spec-smt-native` (commit 56ae24e00); see the manifest's `external_solution`.

Canonical results: `Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo.spec : Spec`; the arithmetic of
`Silmaril.Proofs.WasmSpec.SumTo.Arith` (`tri_succ`, `triBV_step`).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo

/-- The canonical solution: the kernel-checked `tactic` one. -/
theorem spec : Spec := spec_tactic

end Silmaril.WasmSpec.SumTo

